 and make graphics that, at the time, I thought were pretty cool."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"In high school, I started to learn how to code. I remember watching a YouTube series about creating a game in Unity. Then, I took some start classes in high school, and realized that I loved it. You could create anything and everything, and make an impact on the world."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"At this point, I've taken a multitude of classes in college. I've designed and developed a couple of websites, and I've worked on a few projects. I've also taken a lot of classes in AI and machine learning. I've learned a lot about the tech world, and I'm excited to see where it takes me."}],["$","p",null,{"children":"As I approach graduation, I'm excited about the oppurtunities ahead and the future of the tech world. This website showcases some of the projects I've worked on, and some of the things I've learned. My contact information is at the bottom of the page, so feel free to reach out to me!"}]]}]]}]}],["$","$L5",null,{}],["$","section",null,{"id":"contact","className":"min-h-screen bg-footer text-footer-foreground flex flex-col justify-center px-4 md:px-8 lg:px-16","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-6xl mx-auto w-full","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"flex items-center gap-6 mb-16","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"w-16 h-16 rounded-full overflow-hidden bg-background-emphasis/10","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/images/general/profile-picture.jpg","alt":"Profile","className":"w-full h-full object-cover"}]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl text-footer-foreground font-light","children":["Let's work",["$","br",null,{}],"together"]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"space-y-8 mb-16","children":[["$","a",null,{"href":"mailto:dmboynton6@gmail.com","className":"flex flex-col px-6 py-3 rounded-full shine-border group/shine transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] w-fit","style":{"--shine-degree":"-45deg"},"child